.\" SPDX-License-Identifier: BSD-3-Clause
.Dd October 22, 2026
.Dt RESCUE 8
.Os OxideBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm rescue
.Nd the install medium's tools, in one program
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm /rescue/rescue
.Ar tool
.Op Ar argument ...
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The install medium's mfsroot (see
.Xr installer 8 )
stays in memory all the while the medium runs, so its tools are built as
one program,
.Nm ,
with one copy of the libraries they share, as
.Fx Ns 's
.Pa /rescue
is.
Each tool is a hard link to it, such as
.Pa /bin/sh ,
.Pa /bin/ls
or
.Pa /sbin/mount ,
and
.Nm
runs the tool its name says.
Run under its own name, it runs the tool its first argument names, with the
rest as that tool's arguments.
.Pp
The tools are the system's own, built from the same source:
.Xr cat 1 ,
.Xr chmod 1 ,
.Xr cp 1 ,
.Xr date 1 ,
.Xr dd 1 ,
.Xr df 1 ,
.Xr echo 1 ,
.Xr expr 1 ,
.Xr false 1 ,
.Xr grep 1 ,
.Xr hostname 1 ,
.Xr kill 1 ,
.Xr ln 1 ,
.Xr ls 1 ,
.Xr mkdir 1 ,
.Xr mv 1 ,
.Xr ps 1 ,
.Xr pwd 1 ,
.Xr rm 1 ,
.Xr rmdir 1 ,
.Xr sed 1 ,
.Xr sh 1 ,
.Xr sleep 1 ,
.Xr stty 1 ,
.Xr sync 1 ,
.Xr tar 1 ,
.Xr test 1 ,
.Xr touch 1 ,
.Xr true 1 ,
.Xr dhclient 8 ,
.Xr dmesg 8 ,
.Xr efibootmgr 8 ,
.Xr fsck 8 ,
.Xr fsck_msdosfs 8 ,
.Xr fsck_oxfs 8 ,
.Xr growfs 8 ,
.Xr gpart 8 ,
.Xr ifconfig 8 ,
.Xr init 8 ,
.Xr init_sh 8 ,
.Xr mount 8 ,
.Xr mount_msdosfs 8 ,
.Xr mount_tmpfs 8 ,
.Xr newfs_msdos 8 ,
.Xr newfs_oxfs 8 ,
.Xr reboot 8 ,
.Xr route 8 ,
.Xr sysctl 8 ,
.Xr umount 8
and
.Xr wsconsctl 8 .
Its
.Xr sh 1
also takes
.Xr init_sh 8 Ns 's
service blocks.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr installer 8
.Sh HISTORY
A
.Pa /rescue
first appeared in
.Fx 5.2 .
OxideBSD's lives only on the install medium.
